---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | HunterMussel"
  description="How HunterMussel collects, uses, and protects your data — cookies, analytics, advertising, and your choices."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <main class="page">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated: July 10, 2026</p>
    </section>

    <section class="article">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          HunterMussel ("we", "us") operates <a href="https://huntermussel.com">huntermussel.com</a>,
          a site offering software engineering articles, case studies, and free developer tools.
          For anything privacy-related, reach us at
          <a href="mailto:contact@huntermussel.com">contact@huntermussel.com</a>.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Contact form.</strong> When you use our contact form, we store the name, email
          address, and message you submit so we can reply to you. That's it — we don't add you to
          a mailing list.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Usage data.</strong> Like most sites, we collect anonymous usage data (pages
          visited, approximate location, device type) through the analytics services described
          below.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Our tools.</strong> The free tools on this site (image converters, formatters,
          generators, and so on) run entirely in your browser. Files and text you process with
          them are never uploaded to our servers.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>Cookies and third-party services</h2>
        <p>We use the following third-party services, which may set cookies in your browser:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Analytics (GA4)</strong> and <strong>Google Tag Manager</strong> — to
            understand how visitors use the site. Data is aggregated and doesn't identify you
            personally.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google AdSense</strong> — to display ads. Google and its partners may use
            cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can
            opt out of personalized advertising at
            <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>,
            or opt out of third-party cookies generally at
            <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>.
            See how Google uses data at
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Ads conversion tracking</strong> — to measure whether our own ad
            campaigns lead to contact-form submissions or WhatsApp clicks.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Cloudflare</strong> — our hosting provider, which may set cookies for
            security and performance purposes.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Block or delete cookies through your browser settings.</li>
          <li>
            Opt out of Google Analytics with the
            <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener" target="_blank">GA opt-out browser add-on</a>.
          </li>
          <li>Disable personalized ads via the links in the section above.</li>
          <li>
            Email us to request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal data you've
            sent us through the contact form.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>Data retention and security</h2>
        <p>
          Contact-form submissions are kept only as long as needed to handle your request. The
          site is served over HTTPS, and we don't sell or share your personal data with anyone
          beyond the service providers listed above.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is aimed at software professionals and isn't directed at children under 13.
          We don't knowingly collect personal information from children.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          If we change this policy, we'll update this page and the date at the top. Significant
          changes won't apply retroactively to data collected under a previous version.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
